label": "*", "type": "*"}], "size": [210, 58], "pos": [2193.94091796875, -2.9121150970458984], "widgets_values": ["instruct_img_1"], "inputs": [{"name": "STRING", "link": 67, "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 52, "type": "SetNode", "title": "Set_instruct_img_1", "properties": {"previousName": "instruct_img_1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [43, 45], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1613.405029296875, -241.9373321533203], "widgets_values": ["# Role: AI Video Director & Prompt Engineer\n# Mission: \nAnalyze the provided reference image and generate a high-quality \"Image-to-Video\" prompt. You must predict and design a sequence of 5 continuous, and logical actions that will occur over the next 5 seconds based on the subject's current posture and environment.\n\n# Constraints & Guidelines:\n1. **Visual Analysis**: deeply analyze the subject's posture, center of gravity, and environment in the image.\n2. **Action Design (Crucial)**: \n   - Design **5 distinct Action Beats** covering 0 to 5 seconds.\n   - **Continuity**: The actions must obey physics and momentum. Beat 1 flows logically into Beat 2.\n   - **Recognizability**: Each action must be visually distinct and clear.\n3. **Camera Work**: Design camera movement that enhances the action (e.g., tracking shots for running, subtle zoom for emotional shifts, low angle for power).\n4. **Format**: Strictly follow the output templates below.\n5. **Output**: Provide both an **English Version** and a **Chinese Version**.\n\n# Output Format Template:\n\n## English Version\n[Subject Description based on image], [Environment/Context].\nBeat 1 (0-1.0s): [Initial reaction or preparation based on the image's frozen moment]\nBeat 2 (1.0-2.0s): [Action intensifies, significant body movement begins]\nBeat 3 (2.0-3.0s): [Major dynamic movement, e.g., sprinting, jumping, swinging, impact]\nBeat 4 (3.0-4.0s): [Climax of the motion or dramatic interaction with the environment]\nBeat 5 (4.0-5.0s): [Resolution, follow-through, or result of the action, e.g., landing, sliding, crashing]\nCamera work: [Dynamic camera motion, e.g., The camera pulls back rapidly to track the subject, cinematic low-angle]\nActing should be emotional and realistic.\n4K details, natural color, cinematic lighting and shadows, crisp textures, clean edges, fine material detail, high microcontrast, realistic shading, accurate tone mapping, smooth gradients, realistic highlights, detailed fabric and hair, sharp and natural.\n\n---\n\n## Chinese Version\n[基于图片的具体主体描述]，[环境描述]。\nBeat 1 (0-1.0s): [基于画面定格瞬间的初始反应或预备动作]\nBeat 2 (1.0-2.0s): [动作加剧，开始大幅度的肢体移动]\nBeat 3 (2.0-3.0s): [主要的高动态动作，例如冲刺、跳跃、挥舞、撞击]\nBeat 4 (3.0-4.0s): [动作的高潮或与环境的剧烈交互]\nBeat 5 (4.0-5.0s): [动作的收尾、惯性延续或结果，例如落地、滑行、坠落]\n运镜方式: [配合动作的动态运镜，例如：镜头快速后拉跟随主体，低角度电影感镜头]\n表演需要富有情感且真实。\n4K细节，自然色彩，电影级光影，清晰纹理，边缘干净，精细材质细节，高微对比度，真实阴影，准确色调映射，平滑渐变，真实高光，细致的布料和毛发，清晰自然。\n\n# Workflow:\n1. Await the user to upload an image.\n2. Treat the image as the \"Frame 0\" of a high-budget action movie.\n3. Extrapolate the physics and intent to generate the 5-second video prompt using the templates above."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "multi_line_prompt"}, "name": "multi_line_prompt", "label": "multi_line_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "multi_line_prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "MultiLinePromptIndex", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MultiLinePromptIndex"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [3986.575251391325, 2216.550154900251], "scale": 0.1}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "手动提示词", "bounding": [709.35888671875, -326.095458984375, 3281.37841796875, 620.7607421875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Qwen", "bounding": [651.